{"shortDescription":"Spot basis bids for corn and soybeans were mostly steady to stronger in the US Midwest on Thursday, supported by firm demand at river terminals and Chicago elevators, spot checks showed.Basis values are quoted against CBOT futures in cents/bu:NOTE: 0 = Option Price, UNC = Unchanged, UNQ = Unquoted…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Spot basis bids for corn and soybeans were mostly steady to stronger in the US Midwest on Thursday, supported by firm demand at river terminals and Chicago elevators, spot checks showed."]},{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Basis bids for both corn and soybeans improved at Davenport, Iowa, where grain is loaded onto barges for shipment down the Mississippi River to Gulf Coast export facilities."]}]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"p","children":["The soybean basis has strengthened in the Gulf CIF market this week, reflecting exporter demand following a series of US soybean sales to China and lending support to river bids in the Midwest."]}]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Barge freight costs were mixed on Midwest rivers, with offers for empty barges falling on the Mississippi River at St. Louis but rising at Davenport, Iowa, as well as the Memphis-to-Cairo, Illinois, segment."]}]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"p","children":["River levels were declining following a stretch of dry Midwest weather, and draft restrictions were expected next week on the Mississippi around Memphis, Tennessee, one barge source said."]}]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Farmers have been actively harvesting this week across the Midwest and some were finishing up soybeans and moving on to corn, an Indiana merchandiser said."]}]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"p","children":["However, a setback in prices over recent weeks reduced farmer selling and supported basis bids in some areas."]}]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"p","c